        NavigationBar_NavButton__JwONn primary" data-testid="blox-button"><div class="Button_ButtonContent__qPyqO Button_ButtonContent-md__1XTQo"><div class="undefined Button_Text-md__R7FDU Button_BtnText__nrjra  primary " data-testid="text-custom">BOOK PROPERTY</div></div></div></div></div><div class="PropertyDetails_RelativeComponentCtn__xJB6K"><div class="PropertyDetails_BodyWrapper__xzEAL"><div class="PropertyDetails_leftSection__nwaCM"><section id="Overview"><div class="Overview_OverviewMain__jK_BF"><div class="Overview_Overview__Bc1p3 false" data-testid="blox-Overview"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm undefined Overview_HeadingTextOverview__4Xh33"><div class="undefined  text_text-20px__KiVZf" data-testid="text-custom">Overview</div></h2><div class="Overview_OverviewData__cLXua"><div class="TruncatedText_TruncateText__iKHoI text-12 
            undefined
            undefined"><div class="undefined TruncatedText TruncatedText_line-4__CGy8m Overview_OverviewDescriptionTruncText__KLEw7 
                 " data-testid="text-custom">Welcome to this stunning and spacious property located in a highly desirable neighborhood. As you enter the home, you are greeted by a grand foyer with soaring ceilings and an abundance of natural light. The open concept floor plan seamlessly connects the living, dining, and kitchen areas, perfect for both relaxing and entertaining. Adjacent to the kitchen, you will find a cozy breakfast nook with large windows overlooking the beautifully landscaped backyard. The master bedroom suite is a true retreat, boasting a spacious layout, a private en-suite bathroom with a luxurious soaking tub, a separate walk-in shower, and a double vanity in Homes. Additionally, the master suite offers a generous walk-in closet, providing plenty of storage options. This property offers several versatile rooms that can be customized to fit your needs, such as a home office, a gym, or a guest suite. Additional highlights include hardwood flooring throughout, a private backyard oasis with a sparkling pool and a patio area, perfect for outdoor dining and hosting summer gatherings. This property offers the perfect balance of luxury, comfort, and functionality in Homes.</div></div></div><div class="Overview_OverviewGrid__OKQXI false"><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Configuration</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">1 BHK, 2 BHK, 2.5 BHK</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Under construction</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Possession in Dec 2026</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Avg. Price</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">₹26,293/sq.ft</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">RERA Carpet Area</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">464 - 822 sqft</div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="Overview_ListContainer__RcPDE "><div class="Overview_highlightHeading__8JSvd">Why consider <span>buying this property</span>?</div><div class="Overview_HighlightsContainer__cYf_c"><ul class="Overview_Squarelist__NXH7D"><li>Strategically Constructed.</li><li>Good Lightening &amp; Ventilation in all rooms.</li><li>Excellent Homes planning with no wastage in all room</li></ul><ul class="Overview_Squarelist__NXH7D"><li>Access to important landmarks.</li><li>Located in Heart of the City.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section id="AIReviewSummary"><div class="AIReviewSummary_Container__cdZ_7 Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_Header__Z33Z1"><div class="AIReviewSummary_TitleWrapper__VrIqs"><div class="AIReviewSummary_TitleRow__RxyFc"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_Title__r4_AU"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-3__6qV5j" data-testid="text-custom">Google AI Summary</div></h2><span class="AIReviewSummary_Sparkle__4AIGg">✦</span></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_AiBadge__yHMUt"></div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_ContentWrapper__H1KTG" style="max-height:380px"><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_SummaryText__LoG_f text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Modern Development: Reviewers note that this is a contemporary, under-construction project with efficient layouts designed for natural sunlight and ventilation. Eco-Friendly Focus: Multiple users highlight the project&#x27;s sustainability awards, specifically mentioning features like EV charging stations and eco-friendly roofing. Builder Reputation: Feedback regarding Shree Sainath Developers is generally positive, with residents trusting their construction quality and delivery timelines. Compact Living: Some reviews point out that the carpet areas for 1 BHK and 2 BHK units are relatively compact compared to older projects in the vicinity.</div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Grid__9zT79"><div class="AIReviewSummary_PointsCard__WtPbt  Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_CardHeader__W5nac"><img alt="up-thumb" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="AIReviewSummary_CardIcon__x8doc" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg"/><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_CardTitle__3bBl_"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">The good things</div></h3></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Metro Connectivity</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The project is located extremely close to the Dahanukarwadi Metro Station, significantly easing the daily commute for residents.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Prime Location</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">It is situated in a well-developed area of Kandivali West with immediate access to schools like Thakur International and healthcare facilities like Zenith Hospital.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Sustainability Features</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The building includes eco-friendly initiatives that appeal to environmentally conscious buyers and may reduce long-term maintenance costs.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Rooftop Amenities</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Residents appreciate the inclusion of a terrace garden and rooftop seating areas which provide open space in a congested urban setting.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Safety Ratings</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">High safety and lifestyle ratings from local residents indicate a secure environment for families.</div></div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_PointsCard__WtPbt  Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_CardHeader__W5nac"><img alt="down-thumb" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="AIReviewSummary_CardIcon__x8doc" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg"/><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_CardTitle__3bBl_"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">Needs improvement</div></h3></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Traffic Congestion</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The surrounding Mathuradas Road and Link Road experience heavy traffic bottlenecks during peak morning and evening hours.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Under Construction</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">As the project is currently in the structural phase, buyers have expressed concerns regarding potential delays or living in a construction zone.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Noise Pollution</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Being close to the Metro line and major arterial roads leads to constant ambient noise and dust for lower-floor units.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Density</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The single-tower design with over 100 units on a approximately 1-acre plot results in high density and potentially crowded common areas.</div></div></div></div></div><div><hr class="AIReviewSummary_Divider__md7XZ"/><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_VerdictLabel__jEfM0 text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">The Verdict</div><div class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTags___OivB"><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Great for commuters</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Ideal for small families</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">High investment potential</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Good for eco-conscious buyers</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Avoid if seeking large carpet areas</div></span></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_FadeOverlay__CFpBd" style="opacity:1"></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_ToggleContainer__OfGS6 "><button class="AIReviewSummary_ViewMoreBtn__LXBrc"><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_BtnText__a2mA5 text_mobile-cta__98PCA" data-testid="text-custom">REVEAL FULL SUMMARY</div><span class="AIReviewSummary_BtnIcon__HS5CT">✦</span><div class="AIReviewSummary_Shimmer__D9tsE"></div></button></div></div></section><section id="Amenities"><div class="Amenities_Amenities__Idw7g" data-testid="blox-Amenities"><div class="Amenities_AmmCard__Gu2e5 Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="Amenities_AmenitiesHeadingTxt__bxyH0 squarebx rightPos"><h2 class=