ath Prathamesh Elite?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Possession date of Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite is 31 Dec 2026\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the RERA carpet area range of Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The RERA carpet area range for Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite is 464 - 822 sqft\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the price range of Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The price range of Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite is ₹1.22 Cr - 2.16 Cr\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where is Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite located?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite is located at Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite Vijay Park, New Link Rd, Gandhi Nagar, Hemu Colony, Shankar Pada, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What configurations are available in Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite has 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 2.5 BHK configurations.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the status of Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The status of Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite is Under construction.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which amenities are provided in Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Gymnasium, Home Automation, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Landscape Garden, Large Green Area, Maintenance Staff, Senior citizen Area, Walking Area, Yoga Area.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is the developer of Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The developer of Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite is Shree Sainath Developers.\"}}]\n}\n","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Product\",\n  \"name\": \"Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite\",\n  \"image\": \"https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/200323040404-newproject-2023-03-20t160358712.webp\",\n  \"description\": \"Welcome to this stunning and spacious property located in a highly desirable neighborhood. As you enter the home, you are greeted by a grand foyer with soaring ceilings and an abundance of natural light. The open concept floor plan seamlessly connects the living, dining, and kitchen areas, perfect for both relaxing and entertaining. Adjacent to the kitchen, you will find a cozy breakfast nook with large windows overlooking the beautifully landscaped backyard. The master bedroom suite is a true retreat, boasting a spacious layout, a private en-suite bathroom with a luxurious soaking tub, a separate walk-in shower, and a double vanity in Homes. Additionally, the master suite offers a generous walk-in closet, providing plenty of storage options. This property offers several versatile rooms that can be customized to fit your needs, such as a home office, a gym, or a guest suite. Additional highlights include hardwood flooring throughout, a private backyard oasis with a sparkling pool and a patio area, perfect for outdoor dining and hosting summer gatherings. This property offers the perfect balance of luxury, comfort, and functionality in Homes.\",\n  \"brand\": {\n\t\t\"@type\": \"Brand\",\n\t\t\"name\": \"Shree Sainath Developers\"\n\t},\n  \"offers\": {\n\t\t\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\",\n    \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/shree-sainath-prathamesh-elite\",\n\t\t\"priceCurrency\": \"INR\",\n\t\t\"lowPrice\": \"12199952.00\",\n\t\t\"highPrice\": \"21612846.00\"\n\t}\n}\n","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": [\n      \"SingleFamilyResidence\",\n      \"Product\",\n      \"RealEstateListing\"\n  ],\n  \"@id\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/shree-sainath-prathamesh-elite\",\n  \"mpn\": \"P51800029737\",\n  \"brand\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Brand\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/shree-sainath-developers-1a256b13a784\",\n    \"name\": \"Shree Sainath Developers\"\n  },\n  \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/shree-sainath-prathamesh-elite\",\n  \"containedInPlace\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Place\",\n      \"@id\": \"Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/shree-sainath-prathamesh-elite\",\n      \"name\": \"Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite\",\n      \"address\": {\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n          \"streetAddress\": \"Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite Vijay Park, New Link Rd, Gandhi Nagar, Hemu Colony, Shankar Pada, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067\",\n          \"addressLocality\": \"Kandivali West\",\n          \"addressRegion\": \"Mumbai\",\n          \"postalCode\": \"400067\",\n          \"addressCountry\": \"IN\"\n      }\n  },\n  \"description\": \"Welcome to this stunning and spacious property located in a highly desirable neighborhood. As you enter the home, you are greeted by a grand foyer with soaring ceilings and an abundance of natural light. The open concept floor plan seamlessly connects the living, dining, and kitchen areas, perfect for both relaxing and entertaining. Adjacent to the kitchen, you will find a cozy breakfast nook with large windows overlooking the beautifully landscaped backyard. The master bedroom suite is a true retreat, boasting a spacious layout, a private en-suite bathroom with a luxurious soaking tub, a separate walk-in shower, and a double vanity in Homes. Additionally, the master suite offers a generous walk-in closet, providing plenty of storage options. This property offers several versatile rooms that can be customized to fit your needs, such as a home office, a gym, or a guest suite. Additional highlights include hardwood flooring throughout, a private backyard oasis with a sparkling pool and a patio area, perfect for outdoor dining and hosting summer gatherings. This property offers the perfect balance of luxury, comfort, and functionality in Homes.\",\n  \"floorSize\": [\n      {\n          \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n          \"unitCode\": \"SQFT\",\n          \"minValue\": \"464\",\n          \"maxValue\": \"822\"\n      }\n  ],\n  \"image\": [\n      {\n          \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n          \"url\": \"https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/200323040404-newproject-2023-03-20t160358712.webp\"\n      }\n  ],\n  \"name\": \"Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite\",\n  \"offers\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n      \"@id\": \"P51800029737\",\n      \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n      \"name\": \"Sale of Shree Sainath Prathamesh Elite Unit\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/shree-sainath-prathamesh-elite\",\n      \"price\": 12199952.00,\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\n  }\n}\n"],"aiReviewSummary":{"summary":"Modern Development: Reviewers note that this is a contemporary, under-construction project with efficient layouts designed for natural sunlight and ventilation. Eco-Friendly Focus: Multiple users highlight the project's sustainability awards, specifically mentioning features like EV charging stations and eco-friendly roofing. Builder Reputation: Feedback regarding Shree Sainath Developers is generally positive, with residents trusting their construction quality and delivery timelines. Compact Living: Some reviews point out that the carpet areas for 1 BHK and 2 BHK units are relatively compact compared to older projects in the vicinity.","pros":[{"title":"Metro Connectivity","description":"The project is located extremely close to the Dahanukarwadi Metro Station, significantly easing the daily commute for residents."},{"title":"Prime Location","description":"It is situated in a well-developed area of Kandivali West with immediate access to schools like Thakur International and healthcare facilities like Zenith Hospital."},{"title":"Sustainability Features","description":"The building includes eco-friendly initiatives that appeal to environmentally conscious buyers and may reduce long-term maintenance costs."},{"title":"Rooftop Amenities","description":"Residents appreciate the inclusion of a terrace garden and rooftop seating areas which provide open space in a congested urban setting."},{"title":"Safety Ratings","description":"High safety and lifestyle ratings from local residents indicate a secure environment for families."}],"cons":[{"title":"Traffic Congestion","description":"The surrounding Mathuradas Road and Link Road experience heavy traffic bottlenecks during peak morning and evening hours."},{"title":"Under Construction","description":"As the project is currently in the structural phase, buyers have expressed concerns regarding potential delays or living in a construction zone."},{"title":"Noise Pollution","description":"Being close to the Metro line and major arterial roads leads to constant ambient noise and dust for lower-floor units."},{"title":"Density","description":"The single-tower design with over 100 units on a approximately 1-acre plot results in high density and potentially crowded common areas."}],"verdict":["Great for commuters","Ideal for small families","High investment potential","Good for eco-conscious buyers","Avoid if seeking large carpet areas"]},"googleReviews":{"html_attributions":[],"result":{"rating":4.4,"reviews":[{"author_name":"Musharaf Malik","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100189086613478671442/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK8XZZs8ZAtPQJs26EoQNVy1w4S-Ts9mAkN6TvYiEI_44IfLb8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"3 months ago","text":"Wonder project with unexpected elegant location.\nMust visit those who are looking spacious carpet flat in Mumbai","time":1779194157,"translated":false},{"author_name":"24 94","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101290105093030139849/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUmaLKthK-rzuouqUvVROGCLIR5qzMBDxgpujwqpt3TD8bCg9o6=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"3 months ago","text":"One of best project where buyers requirement  is fulfilled according to infrastructure,location ,flat sizes and pricing","time":1779194195,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Kajal Jha","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106737557502738086736/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWNZIpbarh3XC28ivIrDXejGlmiaPcx4mrYSaHin8UOoayxKeRr=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"2 years ago","text":"It is located at very prime location and well connected to station or metro, quite good property for investment and the project is very spacious or good.","time":1711651770,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Manoj Maurya","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114961236299946968032/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJsBy_q7wlKr0vMxhjM7gb9G0CoTXEthEnTjtEs_i8uvhf25A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":4,"relative_time_description":"9 months ago","text":"Nice project","time":1762861488,"translated":false},{"author_name":"AMAAN SALIM","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114016074798119446645/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXI_SR7QcNa63-FAcS3KIjL6rIcci8zQ7Jkqxc66pVaOyYE7Ma0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"3 months ago","text":"Wonderful project","time":1779193939,"translated":false}],"url":"https://maps.google.com/?cid=16729618201758689865","user_ratings_total":18},"status":"OK"}},"isMobile":false,"footerData":{"featured":{"kolkata":{"label":"Kolkata","id":14},"mumbai":{"label":"Mumbai","id":256},"navi-mumbai":{"label":"Navi Mumbai","id":261},"pune":{"label":"Pune","id":300},"thane":{"label":"Thane","id":269}},"others":{"alibaug":{"label":"Alibaug","id":1907},"bangalore":{"label":"Bangalore","id":95},"noida":{"label":"Noida","id":84},"palghar":{"label":"Palghar","id":264},"raigad":{"label":"Raigad","id":3323},"telangana":{"label":"Telangana","id":3326}}},"__N_SSP":true},"page":"/projects/[project_name]","query":{"project_name":"shree-sainath-prathamesh-elite"},"buildId":"t4LZHlTlBLViwyNa5GApO","isFallback":false,"gssp":true,"appGip":true,"scriptLoader":[]}</script></body></html>